          "filename": "StateLibQld 1 14202 Shearers and farm hands at Jondaryan Woolshed, ca. 1872.jpg",
          "caption": "Shearers and farm hands at Jondaryan Woolshed, ca. 1872\nThe shearing shed in the background was erected between 1859 and 1861 when shearing first commenced. The 56 stand shed was built with huge  roof beams imported from England and cedar window frames and shute doors. The shed is the oldest woolshed still operational in Queensland and the first purpose built woolshed in Australia.",
